  + a machine-verifiable ceremony plan is the smallest safe bridge to future explicit operator input

& [WhyNotExecution]
  + no real policy key custody revocation source time witness decision observation permit or broker receipt exists
  + any live implementation would exceed the user directive and current phase lock
  + provider-free planning advances product structure without manufacturing consent

& [Decision]
  + form and sign only a deterministic ceremony-plan compiler verifier evidence and documentation surface
  + require separate source and signatures for ceremony performance and every physical effect
